B.ath=new A.pF("THE PROBLEM","A rule is easier to remember when you can see why it matters.","Annual training often says \u201cdo not approve an unexpected sign-in.\u201d Systems Studio follows that decision through the people, technology, defenses, and assets that depend on it.",B.PV,B.T,B.jL)
B.atk=new A.pF("ONE SMALL ACTION","An employee receives an unexpected approval request.","The request looks routine. Approving it takes one tap. But the tap does not stay on the phone\u2014it becomes evidence that the identity system uses to trust whoever is signing in.",B.n8,B.T,B.jL)
