B.atj=new A.pF("THE CONNECTED SYSTEM","The consequence travels farther than the action.","Approval flows to the identity provider, completes authentication, opens the account, exposes connected information, and creates work for monitoring and recovery. A local choice changes the state of a larger system.",B.bm,B.UY,B.jL)
