B.atg=new A.pF("DIFFERENT VIEWPOINTS","No participant sees the whole event.","The employee sees a prompt. The attacker sees an opportunity. The identity service sees valid approval. The defender may see only an unusual sign-in. Systems Studio lets learners compare those partial views and inspect the causal trace.",B.jB,B.T,B.Tx)
B.ati=new A.pF("EXPLORE, DO NOT JUST MEMORIZE","Change the choice and watch the system change.","Inside the Cybersecurity Lab, learners can study the concept, run the model, compare outcomes, inspect real incidents, and understand why safe verification and rapid reporting matter.",B.dy,B.T,B.jL)
