B.aaf=new A.ld("The tactic attacks decision time","Social engineering does not require an unintelligent or careless target. It creates conditions in which a normally useful habit\u2014obeying authority, helping quickly, or avoiding loss\u2014competes with verification. Pressure tries to make \u201ccheck first\u201d feel costly, rude, or too late.",null)
B.aah=new A.ld("Phishing is social engineering carried by a message","Social engineering is the broader attempt to manipulate a person. Phishing is one method: a deceptive message pretends to come from a trusted person or organization and asks the target to click, open, pay, sign in, or reveal information. It is not limited to email.",null)
B.aai=new A.ld("Scenario: the interrupted recovery","You receive a voice message that sounds like your manager. It says a visiting support technician must restore an executive account before a meeting. A follow-up text contains a support number. Minutes later, someone with equipment cases arrives at the secure door.",null)
